It reads JewelBox Music Library (https://github.com/William-De71/Jewelbox-Music-Library,
MIT License, same author) through its REST API on the local network. The
cover is built from the icon of JewelBox Music Library
(docs/assets/jewelbox-icon.png, copied from client/public/icons/icon-512.png).

The albums, artists and borrowers of the tests and of the generated widget
illustrations are invented, and their covers are plain generated pictures.
